  "quest.5AFAACCAE67C7A94.title": "Welcome to TismCraft",
  "quest.5AFAACCAE67C7A94.quest_subtitle": "Manual challenge - confirm it yourself",
  "quest.5AFAACCAE67C7A94.quest_desc": [
    "Read this first: item tasks check items in your inventory and do not consume them. They do not prove you crafted or placed an item. Checkmark tasks are build challenges you confirm yourself. Complete prerequisites before submitting a task; move an existing item into your inventory again if needed. Rewards are modest XP points, not levels. Mark this page complete when ready.",
    "Manual check: this task does not inspect your build. Click the checkmark after meeting the objective."
  ],
  "task.5A0D20603EF945CA.title": "I completed this challenge",
  "quest.5A9826D10302E7D6.title": "Recipes Are Your Map",
  "quest.5A9826D10302E7D6.quest_subtitle": "Manual challenge - confirm it yourself",
  "quest.5A9826D10302E7D6.quest_desc": [
    "Open JEI and inspect a recipe and its uses. Pin three machines you want to build. This book supplies goals; JEI supplies the recipes for your installed pack. Mark complete after trying both recipe views.",
    "Manual check: this task does not inspect your build. Click the checkmark after meeting the objective."
  ],
